## 2. True Edge-to-Edge & Window Insets Discipline

Modern Android (API 35+) enforces full edge-to-edge layout by default. Never use deprecated `SYSTEM_UI_FLAG_LAYOUT_FULLSCREEN` or fitSystemWindows.

* **Enable Edge-to-Edge in ComponentActivity:**
  ```kotlin
  override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {
      enableEdgeToEdge()
      super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)
      setContent { ... }
  }
  ```
* **Handle Insets with Modifiers:**
  * Status bar: `Modifier.statusBarsPadding()` or `WindowInsets.statusBars`
  * Navigation bar: `Modifier.navigationBarsPadding()`
  * Soft keyboard (IME): `Modifier.imePadding()`
  * Scaffolds: Always consume the `PaddingValues` parameter passed into `Scaffold(content = { padding -> ... })`:
    ```kotlin
    Scaffold { innerPadding ->
        LazyColumn(
            contentPadding = innerPadding,
            modifier = Modifier.fillMaxSize()
        ) { ... }
    }
    ```

